        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    payment = 300\n    annual_rate = 0.04\n    periods = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_value = sum(\n        payment / (1 + annual_rate) ** period\n        for period in range(periods)\n    )\n    answer = round(present_value, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
